flowchart LR
  Platform[Преподавательская платформа]
  Kafka[(Внешний Kafka broker)]
  subgraph Stockio[Stockio strategy service]
    subgraph Adapters[Внешние адаптеры]
      Config[Чтение переменных окружения]
      KafkaAdapter[Kafka adapter]
      HTTP[HTTP health adapter]
    end
    subgraph Application[Слой приложения]
      UseCase[Strategy service use case]
      BrokerPort[Broker port]
      HealthPort[Health port]
      Contracts[Event contracts]
    end
    subgraph Domain[Домен]
      Signal[Signal HOLD]
    end
  end
  Market[Market data publisher]
  Developer[Разработчик]
  Platform -->|settings and provisioned topics| Kafka
  Market -->|market.candle.closed| Kafka
  Kafka -->|свечи и результаты| KafkaAdapter
  KafkaAdapter --> BrokerPort
  BrokerPort --> UseCase
  UseCase --> Contracts
  UseCase --> Signal
  UseCase --> BrokerPort
  BrokerPort -->|регистрация, heartbeat, HOLD| KafkaAdapter
  KafkaAdapter --> Kafka
  Config -->|настройки| UseCase
  HTTP --> HealthPort
  UseCase --> HealthPort
  HTTP -->|GET /health| Developer
